# This repository tracks metadata and tooling only. The six binary data
# directories are present locally for building release archives, but are
# never tracked in Git (ordinary or LFS). Consumers get the bytes from the
# versioned, checksum-verified GitHub Release archives.
/3d/
/audio/
/documents/
/fonts/
/images/
/videos/

# Source backups and OS thumbnail caches are never part of the snapshot.
*.bak
Thumbs.db
